[Intro]

[Verse 1]
[00:26.55]Home from the field with our boots full of blood
[00:29.36]Home with our axes still warm in the hand
[00:32.38]The crows had their fill and the gods had their song
[00:35.13]And the mead-hall doth stand where the mead-hall doth stand!

[00:38.35]The kings we did harry, the walls we did break
[00:41.29]The widows we made, well, we'll not name them here
[00:44.17]But the bench it is long and the horn it is deep
[00:46.89]And the cup of forgetting is brewed of good beer!

[Pre-Chorus]
[00:50.63]Pour, pour, pour the horn!
[00:53.40]Drink, drink, drink it dry!

[Chorus]
[00:56.42]Skål! Til Skogarmóðir!
[00:59.34]Skål! Til Næturkonungr!
[01:02.31]Skål to the brother who fell on the road
[01:05.30]Skål to the bastard who lived!
[01:08.58]Drekkum, drekkum, til dagrenningar!
[01:11.26]Drink till the dawn doth arise!
[01:14.17]The mead-hall holds no saints tonight
[01:16.95]And the saints would not be missed!

[Verse 2]
[01:27.55]Old Bjarki he weepeth in ale to his beard
[01:30.59]For a woman who left him in seasons long gone
[01:33.45]Young Hrafn on the table is dancing again
[01:36.48]With a boot on his head and no breeches on!

[01:39.95]The priest at the door tried to speak of his god
[01:42.67]We bought him a horn and he speaketh no more
[01:45.84]He singeth the old songs, he danceth the round
[01:48.61]And he sleepeth quite well on the mead-hall floor!

[Pre-Chorus]
[01:51.92]Pour, pour, pour the horn!
[01:54.89]Drink, drink, drink it dry!

[Chorus]
[01:57.94]Skål! Til Skogarmóðir!
[02:00.71]Skål! Til Næturkonungr!
[02:03.80]Skål to the brother who fell on the road
[02:06.77]Skål to the bastard who lived!
[02:10.01]Drekkum, drekkum, til dagrenningar!
[02:12.77]Drink till the dawn doth arise!
[02:15.54]The mead-hall holds no saints tonight
[02:18.63]And the saints would not be missed!

[Bridge]
[02:22.11]Hej!
[02:27.84]To the man on my left who shall vomit ere long!
[02:30.81]Hej!
[02:31.64]To the woman on my right who shall outdrink us all!
[02:33.83]Hej!
[02:34.39]To the dog 'neath the table who eateth our scraps!
[02:36.77]Hej!
[02:37.27]To the roof, to the rafters, to the bones in the wall!

[Breakdown]
[02:43.20]Who shall pay?
[02:44.33]Not I!
[02:45.82]Who shall pay?
[02:47.35]Not I!
[02:48.88]Who shall pay?
[02:51.26]The dead shall pay! For the dead drink free!

[Final Chorus]
[03:18.95]Skål! Til Skogarmóðir!
[03:21.81]Skål! Til Næturkonungr!
[03:24.86]Skål to the brother who fell on the road
[03:27.80]Skål to the bastard who lived!
[03:31.13]Drekkum, drekkum, til dagrenningar!
[03:33.72]Drink till the dawn doth arise!
[03:36.89]The mead-hall holds no saints tonight
[03:39.75]And the saints would not be missed!

[Outro]
[03:43.60]Skål...
